title: Infoblox: Global DNS configuration
agents: infoblox_csp
catalog: cloud/infoblox
license: GPLv2
distribution: mkp
description:
 Reports the tenant wide DNS configuration, including DNSSEC validation
 settings, recursion, configured forwarders and cache TTL values.

 This check reports configuration rather than health and is always {OK}. It
 exists so that a change to a global setting is visible in the service
 history and so that TTL values can be graphed.

discovery:
 One service is created on the tenant host when a global DNS configuration
 is present.
